
# type(scope): short summary in English, imperative, lowercase, no period, max 72 chars
#
# Optional body after a blank line: what changes and why.
#
# Types:
#   feat      new feature             fix       bug fix
#   docs      documentation           style     formatting, no behavior change
#   refactor  code restructuring      perf      performance
#   test      tests                   build     dependencies, Vite
#   ci        GitHub Actions          chore     other (config, cleanup)
#   revert    reverts a commit
# Scope is optional: slides, poster, pptx, docx, export, preview, themes, fonts,
#   editor, bib, i18n, ui
# Change that breaks saved themes or files: add ! after the type, e.g. feat(themes)!: ...
#
# Examples:
#   feat(poster): add A2 size
#   fix(pptx): fix spacing below table caption
#   docs: describe GitHub Pages deployment
